## 3. End-to-End Mathematical & Pipeline Data Flow

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["Raw Sensor Stream<br>(IMU 100Hz + GNSS 1Hz)"] --> B["SensorPacket Ingestion<br>(Timestamp, Accel, Gyro, GNSS)"]
    B --> C["NavigationEngine.process_packet()"]
    
    subgraph Prediction["EKF Time Propagation (100Hz)"]
        C --> D["Propagate Orientation (Quaternion Multiplication)"]
        D --> E["Transform Acceleration from Body to ENU Frame"]
        E --> F["Integrate Velocity & Position (Kinematics)"]
        F --> G["Propagate Error Covariance Matrix P (15x15)"]
    end
    
    subgraph ModeSwitch["GNSS Availability Gate"]
        G --> H{"GNSS Available?"}
    end

    subgraph HealthyPath["GNSS Healthy Mode (95% Confidence)"]
        H -->|YES| I["EKF GNSS Measurement Update"]
        I --> J["Correct Position, Velocity & Sensor Biases"]
        J --> K["State: HEALTHY"]
    end

    subgraph OutagePath["GNSS Denied Mode (Tunnel / Forest Blackout)"]
        H -->|NO| L["Buffer IMU Window (20 samples x 6-DoF)"]
        L --> M["AIVelocityEstimator.forward()"]
        M --> N["Predict Forward Speed & Uncertainty"]
        N --> O["EKF Velocity Measurement Update"]
        O --> P["Apply Non-Holonomic Constraints (Vx=0, Vz=0)"]
        P --> Q["Probabilistic Map Matcher Polyline Snap"]
        Q --> R["State: GNSS_DENIED / AI_ASSISTED_DR"]
    end

    K --> S["Output NavigationState (ENU Position, Velocity, Heading, Confidence)"]
    R --> S
    S --> T["Render on Google Maps Cockpit UI (http://127.0.0.1:3000)"]
```

